<title>USA: Green Tree files $1 bln shelf offering.</title>
<headline>Green Tree files $1 bln shelf offering.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-08-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Green Tree Financial Corp filed Friday  with the U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission a shelf offering  of up to $1 billion in certificates for home improvement and home  equity loans.</p>
<p>The certificates represent ownership in a trust consisting of home  improvement and home equity loans.</p>
<p>No underwriters were named in the filing.</p>
</text>
